Description: Use QtGlobal for Qt integer types on Qt 6.4
 The QtTypes convenience header used by Whatsie 5.1.0 is not available
 in Ubuntu 24.04's Qt 6.4 development headers. QtGlobal provides the
 qint64 and quint32 types required by the identicon implementation and
 remains available on newer Qt 6 releases.
Author: Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-08-13

Index: whatsie/src/identicons.h
===================================================================
--- whatsie.orig/src/identicons.h
+++ whatsie/src/identicons.h
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 #ifndef IDENTICONS_H
 #define IDENTICONS_H
 
-#include <QtTypes>
+#include <QtGlobal>
 #include <QSize>
 #include <QImage>
 #include <QPixmap>
